LOCUS       homing_targets          2798 bp    DNA     circular SYN 26-APR-2026
DEFINITION  Synthetic homing-endo target plasmid. pUC19 with I-CeuI,
            I-SceI, PI-PspI, PI-SceI canonical sites inserted..
ACCESSION   homing_endo_targets
