            .
COMMENT     synthetic fixture. Base sequence: pUC19 (NCBI L09137, public
            domain). The four homing endonuclease recognition sites are inserted
            at fixed offsets so cut-site tests can assert against canonical
            positions. Generated by tools/devops/scripts/build-test-fixtures.py.
